{
  "$schema": "https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json",
  "_doc": [
    "Vercel deploy config for explorer.ligate.io (#2).",
    "",
    "The explorer is a pure Next.js 15 app; the indexer that feeds it",
    "moved to ligate-api (deployed separately on Railway). So this",
    "config is just the frontend bits: build command, framework",
    "preset, and ignore-rules so Vercel doesn't redeploy on unrelated",
    "changes.",
    "",
    "Env vars (set in the Vercel project's Environment Variables UI;",
    "see docs/deploy.md):",
    "- USE_MOCK_API=false       (prod default; falls back to live api)",
    "- NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.ligate.io",
    "- NEXT_PUBLIC_RPC_URL=https://rpc.ligate.io",
    "",
    "Custom domain wired via Vercel UI: explorer.ligate.io CNAME →",
    "cname.vercel-dns.com. TLS auto-managed by Vercel."
  ],
  "framework": "nextjs",
  "buildCommand": "pnpm build",
  "installCommand": "pnpm install --frozen-lockfile",
  "outputDirectory": ".next",
  "git": {
    "deploymentEnabled": {
      "main": true
    }
  },
  "ignoreCommand": "git diff --quiet HEAD^ HEAD ':(exclude)README.md' ':(exclude)docs/**'",
  "headers": [
    {
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "X-Frame-Options",
          "value": "DENY"
        },
        {
          "key": "X-Content-Type-Options",
          "value": "nosniff"
        },
        {
          "key": "Referrer-Policy",
          "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
